----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Free Non-Commercial Use: you may copy, modify, build and run the Software
   free of charge for personal, educational, research, non-commercial, or
   internal organizational use (not sold externally).
2. Free Open-Source Derivative Exception: you may create and distribute
   Derivative Works free of charge as open source, provided that (a) the
   Derivative Work as a whole is licensed under this same license
   (share-alike), (b) it is provided free of charge with complete source,
   and (c) it prominently credits "Uses ZhuMo ZhuMo (<repo URL>), licensed
   under ZM-SAL-1.0" and retains this license and copyright notices.
3. Commercial Use Requires a Paid Commercial License: any Commercial Use
   (selling, licensing, or hosting the Software or Derivative Works as part
   of a paid product or service) requires a prior written commercial license
   and fee. Internal use that is not sold externally is not Commercial Use.
4. No warranty; liability limited to the maximum extent permitted by law.
